   "x": 300,
   "y": 920,
   "width": 900,
   "height": 60,
   "text": "Best for mid-size loads (typically 6+ pallets): pay only for the space used.\nA few pickups and drops on one trailer; slower than FTL, cheaper per pallet.\nLTL (1-6 pallets) adds terminal cross-docks between pickup and delivery.",
